    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Returning to market due to \"failed financing\" by the previously agreed purchasers:\r\n\r\n9 Whitebridge Manor, Killarney, Co. Kerry V93 RXE9  \r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Killarney’s most convenient residential locations, 9 Whitebridge Manor offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a solid family home with huge potential.  This three-bedroom semi-detached property sits on the edge of Killarney town, within easy reach of schools, churches, shops, sports facilities and all local amenities. \r\n\r\nWhether you prefer to walk, cycle or drive, everything you need is close at hand.  The property has benefited from several important upgrades in recent years, including replacement windows and doors (2012), while the former attached garage has been re-roofed and converted into a versatile additional room (2012), currently used as a home office, with a utility room to the rear.  \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises: 3 spacious bedrooms, main bathroom, kitchen, dining room, sitting room with fireplace. The property benefits from the renovated garage space, it presents now as a home office but it could be playroom, extra bedroom or bathroom. The utility room off the kitchen leads to outside. The property enjoys a surprisingly private rear garden, perfect for relaxing or entertaining, along with a generous front garden offering great curb appeal.  \r\n\r\nWhile the home would benefit from some modernisation and cosmetic updating, it has all the ingredients of a fantastic family home or investment property. Having most recently been used as a rental property, it presents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or anyone looking to put their own stamp on a well-located house with great bones.  \r\n\r\nA great house, in a great area, with great potential.  Contact us today to arrange your viewing"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Windows and door are 12 years old\r\nGarage re-roofed in the past decade\r\nThe cavity has been filled (BER rating of C)\r\nGarage space was turned into living space it has been fitted with Kingspan insulation.\r\nThe fireplace has a back boiler for home heating"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C\r\nBER Number: 101943447"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Tenant is still in situ. Open viewings will be offered in the coming weeks at their convenience."
      }
    ],
